  `references/pave-composition.schema.json` (vendored from pave-init) so its
  composition check runs; the implementer's effort pins drop a capture-class
  node it does not own. The compile-cost rule now names the Torch-to-HLO-to-BIR
  front end. Six more dead citations repointed: three guards cited an
  `enforcement-record.md` never shipped (one also cited a pave-init reference
  as local); a hook message and a seat contract sent readers to a lead-skill
  paragraph that is now a pointer.
- Fourteen restatements collapse to pointers (§4.13 prose duty, §4.12 cap,
  §4.10 durable host state and capture-launch ruling, §4.6 scan census, §4.5
  instrument-liveness pair, measurement-pitfalls stable-reads). The lead
  skill's instrument-liveness row now names the smoke record and the bundle's
  evaluated-threshold record. The implementer's no-progress detector copy is
