here; the three acceptance-instrument duties land as ledger revision 5
(32 nodes and 95 edges unchanged, checks 15 → 16), whose shapes this release
carries, so the two are one landing.

- Provenance: 713 candidates → 342 consolidated → 172 carried. Filters (drop):
  stated in public documentation with a quotable URL, stated by an installed
  Neuron skill, not still true at SDK 2.32 / vllm-neuron 0.24; refuters:
  truth, value. 42 unverifiable and 66 contested are deliberately absent. All
